From 78152f4f132937be25ede2dde86975d1f5524235 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 0cwa <0@none.org>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:37:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt Molly integrations and tests to Signal 8.33.2

Update linked-device provisioning and FCM cleanup for the current service APIs while preserving proxy configuration, error types, user-selected delivery and retry credentials. Move remaining event producers and lifecycle-bound subscribers to Signal's event bus.

Repair lock-aware receivers, encrypted backup preference imports, retained donation completion, dynamic theme resources and moved branding references. Keep Molly's excluded profile-badge and payment-wallet features excluded, and adapt inherited test fixtures accordingly.

Add transport and cleanup regressions for MollySocket, UnifiedPush and FCM.

AI-assisted compatibility changes: restore imports across source checkpoints.

AI-assisted compatibility changes: use a seven-day duration in the existing backup exporter test.

AI-assisted compatibility changes: restore Molly logger collection.

Carry this AI-assisted source change as its own
reviewable patch, preserving the original source author and diff.
The official Molly snapshot and earlier resolution patches do
not receive regenerated provenance headers.

Source-Commit: 0fd34d542166482b6c58fae49d554f61d2e8d15f
AI-Generated: true

